8 mutations are server-run (online app: no action): compactReceipts (reads receipt-owned or derived field members.deliveredOrdinal), delivered (reads receipt-owned or derived field conversations.lastOrdinal), follow (writes online-only table follows), leave (receipt membership changes and progress need settled state), seen (reads receipt-owned or derived field conversations.lastOrdinal), setTyping (writes online-only table typing), stopTyping (writes online-only table typing), unfollow (writes online-only table follows); 4 mutations have insert arms that may queue; 3 eligible mutations may queue past a horizon — snapback4 why <op>
